# ✦ LUXÉRA — Premium E-Commerce Experience

A modern and sophisticated e-commerce website designed to deliver a premium online shopping experience. Combining elegant aesthetics, refined UI elements, and responsive layouts to create a seamless digital storefront.

## ✨ Overview

LUXÉRA is a stylish e-commerce experience built with a focus on modern design, usability, and performance. Every detail is designed to provide visitors with a clean, intuitive, and visually appealing shopping experience.

## 🚀 Features

- Premium and modern user interface
- Fully responsive design
- Elegant product presentation
- Smooth navigation experience
- Modern typography and layouts
- Interactive UI elements
- Clean and organized code structure
- Optimized for desktop and mobile screens

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

